; where a page's load goes, stage by stage (docs/plans/plan_performance.md;
; the technique in docs/dev/notes_debugging_techniques.txt, session 2): not a
; test, run by hand, from the repository's root:
;   dune build scripts/perf/Page_bench.exe
;   ./_build/default/scripts/perf/Page_bench.exe https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OCaml
; -open Network as the browser's libraries; the software platform, as
; the tests: browser_display's shapes are the Playground's.
(executable
 (name Page_bench)
 (modules Page_bench)
 (flags (:standard -open Network))
 (libraries unix caps mini_opti network lang_html lang_css browser_layout browser_url browser_display browser_www browser_viewers browser_about
   tiny_libs.graphics_core ; Framebuffer, what the rasterizer draws into
   elm_playground elm_playground_software))

